From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 08:15:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] bin: add a riscv64 cibw_before_all_linux script

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [new riscv64 port, not an upstream platform]

python-flint's own cibuildwheel config dispatches per architecture via
bin/cibw_before_all_linux_$(uname -m).sh (pyproject.toml's
[tool.cibuildwheel.linux] before-all), with a script already present
for x86_64 and aarch64 but none for riscv64. Add one that mirrors the
existing two verbatim but for the riscv64 host triplet: it builds GMP,
MPFR and FLINT from the same upstream source tarballs
(bin/build_dependencies_unix.sh, bin/build_variables.sh) with no
riscv64-specific changes to that shared script.

GMP 6.3.0 has a native riscv64 assembly path (configure.ac's
riscv64-*-* case, asm_path=riscv/64); FLINT 3.6.0 has no riscv64-
specific code at all and falls through configure.ac's default case
(asm_path="" param_path=generic), the same portable-C path it already
uses on every non-x86_64/non-arm64 architecture it supports (s390x,
ppc64le, ...). Neither needs a patch of its own.
---
 bin/cibw_before_all_linux_riscv64.sh | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)
 create mode 100755 bin/cibw_before_all_linux_riscv64.sh

diff --git a/bin/cibw_before_all_linux_riscv64.sh b/bin/cibw_before_all_linux_riscv64.sh
new file mode 100755
index 0000000..9a523e2
--- /dev/null
+++ b/bin/cibw_before_all_linux_riscv64.sh
@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+#!/usr/bin/env bash
+
+set -e
+
+yum install -y xz
+bin/build_dependencies_unix.sh\
+  --gmp gmp\
+  --host riscv64-pc-linux-gnu\
+  --use-gmp-github-mirror
